OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Boelo brings floods, travel
OL,4,Adisruption, and power cuts for tens of
OL,5,Athousands
OL,6,
OL,7,FStorm Boelo is bringing flooding,
OL,8,Ftravel disruption, and power cuts
OL,9,Facross the UK
OL,11,FOn the railways, people are being told
OL,12,Fnot to travel north of Preston on the
OL,13,FWest Coast Main Line - while on the
OL,14,FEast Coast, LNER advises against travel
OL,15,Fnorth of Edinburgh
OL,17,FIn Scotland, Network Rail says trees
OL,18,Fhave fallen onto lines at "numerous
OL,19,Flocations", while many ferry services
OL,20,Fare also suspended
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
